        "raw": "<p>Conclave of Niphon can install the Universal Link tech card on any ship in the sector. Let&#39;s suppose that they install it on Marot&#39;s Folly. Marot&#39;s Folly then installs Weapons Calibrator, which allows them to recycle a tech installed on the ship. I have a few questions related to this scenario:</p><p>When Marot&#39;s Folly recycles Universal Link, what happens? Does it get recycled into the Marot&#39;s Folly deck or the Conclave of Niphon deck?</p><p>If it goes into the Marot&#39;s Folly deck, what happens when they install it again? Does Conclave of Niphon still gain a weapon energy? What if it&#39;s in another sector? What if it&#39;s grounded? Resurrection!</p><p>If I forget to take the card out of the Marot&#39;s Folly deck at the end of the game and it gets installed in a subsequent game where Conclave of Niphon isn&#39;t present, does Conclave of Niphon start its next game with a bonus weapon energy?</p>",
