        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Foote\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/48/1877_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Foote:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I want to say it goes back under Conclaves deck when recycled, but I am not totally confident in that answer.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's how I've been playing it. I think it makes the most sense, if only because it avoids complications. But it messes with an otherwise simple and consistent use of the word \"recycle,\" so I'm not totally comfortable with it.</p>",
